  "historical_output_text": " A recent afternoon unfolded unexceptioningly as any ordinary Thursday, a day that could just fit in my life with minimal alteration and without any significant impact—much like many days have, blending one after a seemingly similar course of actions, from breakfast in an almost automatic sequence and work until it felt time again. But then in my usual post-office routine—arrival just when closing hours nebulised into an unmissably looming end of another working session—a piece stood alone amongst a few more like them; unsorted.\n\nIn its unpretending state it sat quietly among others with the promise that was yet hidden from my gaze or the others",
